# ---------------------------------------------------------------- 0.1.4 GapDamage (Filter group, BEFORE ArmorDamageReduction): a player's hit
# on a levelled mob x dealt(d) (spec 3.3). Attacker = a player (PlayerRef on the source ref; a projectile's source is a ProjectileSource =
